<title>HONG KONG: S&amp;P raises Development Bank of China to BBB-Plus.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P raises Development Bank of China to BBB-Plus.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Wednesday it had raised its issuer credit rating and senior unsecured debt rating on the State Development Bank of China to BBB-plus from BBB.</p>
<p>In a statement. the rating agency also said it had revised the outlook of the bank to stable from positive.</p>
</text>
